  "resume": "This record documents a parliamentary interpellation by Paul Rechsteiner regarding the Regio-Express train service between St. Gallen and Constance during the 2015 Swiss Council of States session. It includes the official minutes of the debate featuring speeches by several councilors. The content is derived from the official session recordings and published bulletin."
